OL,3,GNEWSA'Heart of gold' dad-of-two killed
OL,4,Ain pub stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father-of-two who died after being
OL,7,Fstabbed outside a pub has been
OL,8,Fdescribed by his family as a "happy
OL,9,Flad" who was "full of life" and had a
OL,10,F"heart of gold".
OL,12,FAyden Cooper, 25, was found with
OL,13,Fserious injuries in the car park of the
OL,14,FBeggars Bush pub on Chester Road,
OL,15,FSutton Coldfield, shortly before 02:00
OL,16,FBST on Sunday and was pronounced dead
OL,17,Fat the scene.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
