OL,3,GNEWSA'Heart of gold' dad-of-two killed
OL,4,Ain pub stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a tribute released through West
OL,7,FMidlands Police, his parents said they
OL,8,Fnever imagined they would be burying
OL,9,Ftheir son just weeks before his 26th
OL,10,Fbirthday.
OL,12,F"Ayden was a happy lad. He was a son,
OL,13,Fbrother, husband, uncle and father to
OL,14,Ftwo beautiful children," they said.
